ustomer record.\u000a\u000aPayments\u000aCollect credit card, ACH, recurring payments, and payment links — with status updates in real time.\u000a\u000aBreeze assistant\u000aGet AI help inside HubSpot — drafting, summarizing, and answering questions on the fly.\u000a\u000aCustomer agent\u000aCustomers can check invoice status, ask billing questions, and pay through customer agent.\u000a\u000aRevenue reporting\u000aGive every team one shared view of what''s been quoted, billed, and collected.\u000a\u000aExternal revenue integrations\u000aBring revenue data from your existing finance tools into HubSpot, for one full picture.\u000a\u000aRevenue agent\u000aThe revenue agent (coming soon) chases overdue invoices on your team''s behalf.\u000a\u000aHubSpot MCP connectors\u000aBring HubSpot data into your favorite AI tools through native MCP connectors.\u000aPRICING\u000aRevenue Hub for every stage of growth.\u000aStart free. Grow into the full revenue process. Pairs perfectly with Sales Hub and all HubSpot tools.\u000a\u000aExplore Sales Hub\u000afree\u000aFree\u000aNo credit card required\u000a\u000a$0/month\u000a\u000aPOPULAR FEATURES\u000a\u000aInvoices\u000aPayment links\u000aSubscriptions\u000aprofessional\u000aProfessional\u000aStarts at\u000a\u000a$95/month\u000a\u000aPOPULAR FEATURES\u000a\u000aQuotes\u000aContracts\u000aE-signature (25/user/month)\u000aRevenue analytics suite\u000aAutomated sales tax\u000aenterprise\u000aEnterprise\u000aStarts at\u000a\u000a$140/month\u000a\u000aPOPULAR FEATURES\u000a\u000aEverything in Professional\u000aAdvanced quote approvals\u000aE-signature (50/user/month)\u000aGet a demo of premium editionsof Revenue Hub\u000aStart 14-day free trialof Revenue Hub\u000a*For more detailed information on product packaging and the limits that apply, please see our pricing page. Price shown in USD and subject to applicable tax.\u000a\u000aFrequently Asked Questions About Revenue Hub Software\u000a\u000a\u000aWhat is Revenue Hub?\u000a\u000a\u000a